#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/netscaler.rst:51
msgid ""
"Load Balancers can be added to Instances during Provisioning or to existing "
"Instances. For Load Balancer settings to appear during provisioning, or for "
"the scale tab to be available on an Instance, the instances Node Type must "
"have a LB port defined."
msgstr ""
"Load Balancers se puede agregar to Instances durante Provisioning o to "
"existente Instances. For Load Balancer configuración to appear durante "
"provisioning, o para el scale pestaña to be disponible on un Instance, la "
"instancias Node Type debe tienen un LB puerto definido."

#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/netscaler.rst:53
