#: ../../integration_guides/LoadBalancers/netscaler.rst:96
msgid ""
"After all nodes in the Instance are provisioned, the LB configuration will "
"be added to the Instance and Virtual Servers, Services and Servers will be "
"created and configured on the NetScaler. The Load Balancer settings and "
"status will be visible in the Instance details page LOAD BALANCER section, "
"with additional details, links, and configurations options available in the "
"``SCALE`` tab."
msgstr ""
"After todos nodes in el Instance son provisioned, el LB configuración será "
"be agregado to el Instance y Virtual Servers, Services y Servers será creado"
" y configurado on el NetScaler. The Load Balancer configuración y estado "
"será be visible in el Instance detalles página LOAD BALANCER sección, con "
"adicional detalles, links, y configurations opciones disponible in el "
"``SCALE`` pestaña."
